      "message": "Please add documentation. What is the callback, when should it be called.\n\nIf I understand correctly, you have a very specific callback in mind. Namely it will be method that triggers changeModel reload. In this case, it should be named appropriately, ie. triggerChangeModelReload. That way it\u0027s clear to a plugin implementation when should they call the method and what will it do.",
