      "writtenOn": "2025-07-01T11:56:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e If I understand correctly, you have a very specific callback in mind. Namely it will be method that triggers changeModel reload\n\nThis is not how the plugin API is meant to be used.\n\nThe provider simply sends the signal. What the clients choose to do with it is not part of the `subscribe` method. Hence the name `callback` is correct, it can be anything.\n\n`Clients can use these signals to refresh the change state.` This is already present in the interface doc.\n\nWhat exactly is missing?",
